        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): load bootstrap files from agentDir alongside workspace",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nPer-agent `agentDir` bootstrap files (`SOUL.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `TOOLS.md`, etc.) were silently ignored when `agentDir` differed from `workspaceDir`. Loads bootstrap files from `agentDir` when explicitly configured, with agentDir files overriding workspace files of the same name. Filters `agentDir`-root `BOOTSTRAP.md` after setup completion, matching workspace behavior.\n\nResolves `agentId` from `sessionKey` via `resolveSessionAgentIds` when not explicitly provided, so agentDir bootstrap fallback works for session-key-based invocations (heartbeat, cron).\n\n## Linked context\n\nCloses #29387\n\n## Real Behavior Proof\n\n### Test Results (vitest 4.1.9)\n\nRebased onto origin/main (b3301e32127).\n\n```\n✓ src/agents/bootstrap-files.test.ts (40 tests, 100% pass, 7.35s)\n```\n\n### Commands\n\n```\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs --config test/vitest/vitest.agents-core.config.ts src/agents/bootstrap-files.test.ts\n```\n\n### Before/After\n\n- Before: Agent with `agentDir: \"/data/agent1\"` and `agentDir/AGENTS.md` had zero enforcement; sessionKey invocations (heartbeat/cron) couldn't resolve agentDir\n- After: AgentDir AGENTS.md loads and overrides workspace AGENTS.md for both direct agentId and sessionKey-based invocations\n\n### What was not tested\n\nLive CLI/Gateway session with multiple agents and different agentDir configurations\n\n## Risk checklist\n\n- Did user-visible behavior change? Yes - agentDir bootstrap files now load and can override workspace files\n- Did config, environment, or migration behavior change? No (explicit config required)\n- Did security, auth, secrets, network, or tool execution behavior change? Yes - new bootstrap source can affect agent instructions\n- What is the highest-risk area? Session state and security boundary: new file source changes agent instructions\n- How is that risk mitigated? Only applies when `agentDir` is explicitly configured\n\nRebased onto origin/main (b3301e32127). Latest commit: 9c6483c5ed4",
